{"id":"n48194-1-8","stage":5,"title":"되새기다 · 咀嚼","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48194-1-8-1","ko":"너는 왜 밥을 삼키지를 않고 계속 되새기고만 있니?","zh":"你怎么一直嚼饭，却不咽下去？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥을","audio":"/audio/59f360b400889823dcc4.mp3"}},{"text":"삼키지를","meaning":"咽，吞下","explanation":"삼키다：咽，吞下；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"삼키다","audio":"/audio/f284493d7a89b53f118b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16747","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼키지를","audio":"/audio/bb362145d66226922fd8.mp3"}},{"text":"않고","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않고","audio":"/audio/0a35d31b8ad5abd7d1f4.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"되새기고만","meaning":"咀嚼","explanation":"되새기다：咀嚼；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"되새기다","audio":"/audio/e483d6300354d863dd20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48194","senseId":"1","lemma":"되새기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되새기고만","audio":"/audio/f7d7acf6048a17baffb2.mp3"}},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있니","audio":"/audio/5cc802647eea2944ec84.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"f284493d7a89b53f","term":"삼키다","zh":"咽，吞下","audio":"/audio/f284493d7a89b53f118b.mp3","entryId":"16747","definition":"将某物放进嘴里后使其从嗓子眼落下去。","pronunciation":["삼키다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"e483d6300354d863","term":"되새기다","zh":"咀嚼","audio":"/audio/e483d6300354d863dd20.mp3","entryId":"48194","definition":"由于吃饱了或没胃口而不吞咽食物一直在嘴里嚼。","pronunciation":["되새기다","뒈새기다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f52c15b2afb98db2cfe1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48194-1-8-2","ko":"잠깐 딴생각 중이었어.","zh":"刚才在想别的事。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠깐","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}},{"text":"딴생각","meaning":"胡思乱想","explanation":"딴생각：胡思乱想","readings":[{"term":"딴생각","audio":"/audio/13839e3cc8dc2a7df5bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50492","senseId":"2","lemma":"딴생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"딴생각","audio":"/audio/13839e3cc8dc2a7df5bb.mp3"}},{"text":"중이었어.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이었어","audio":"/audio/07f6c6b648a409939dbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57312","definition":"非常短的时间。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"13839e3cc8dc2a7d","term":"딴생각","zh":"胡思乱想","audio":"/audio/13839e3cc8dc2a7df5bb.mp3","entryId":"50492","definition":"想一些本不该关心的事情。","pronunciation":["딴생각"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]}],"audio":"/audio/45f62902a07aea23bd02.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.302,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48194","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecomm